{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07357","headline":"对雨赠济阴马少府考城蒋少府兼献成武五兄南华二兄 · 刘长卿","name":"对雨赠济阴马少府考城蒋少府兼献成武五兄南华二兄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"繁云兼家思，弥望连济北。\n日暮微雨中，州城带秋色。\n萧条主人静，落叶飞不息。\n乡梦寒更频，虫声夜相逼。\n二贤纵横器，久滞徒劳职。\n笑语和风骚，雍容事文墨。\n吾兄即时彦，前路良未测。\n秋水百丈清，寒松一枝直。\n此心欲引托，谁爲生羽翼。\n且复顿归鞍，杯中雪胸臆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07357.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07357","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}